+    // 8. structured text (fleet 10-15: structured -21 % with the model). MTP verifies three confident right drafts (4
+    //    tokens per v4 + m + 2e = 68.3 ms), DFlash2 seven (8 per v8 + d = 104.1 ms), but for a stretch DFlash2 drafts one
